        <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:selichot/penitential_second_day/tashev_enosh">
          <tei:pb n="106" ed="1912" facs="https://archive.org/download/selichothdavidasher1912/page/n214_medium.jpg"/>
          <tei:p>Thou turnest man to destruction; and sayest, Return, ye children of men. I will heal their backsliding, I will love them freely: for mine anger is turned away from him. Turn thou us unto thee, O Lord, and we shall be turned: renew our days as of old. </tei:p>
        </tei:div>
